desc: Squishy Compressor (Squeezer port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
version: 1.1
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
tags: compressor dynamics sidechain opto fet feedback parallel
about:
  A flexible general-purpose compressor with a touch of citrus: feed-forward or feed-back design, FET or optical
  gain stage, linear, smooth or logarithmic release, peak or RMS sensing, hard, medium or soft knee, upward
  expansion below a ratio of 1:1, stereo link, input trim, auto or manual make-up gain, wet mix for parallel
  compression, and a side-chain with an external input (pins 3/4), high-pass and low-pass filters and listen.
  Every knob snaps to tuned values; click its orange lamp to make it continuous. Four skins: Default, Lemonade, Lime and Blood Orange.
  Ported from Squeezer by Martin Zuther, https://github.com/mzuther/Squeezer (GPL-3.0).
  Skin "Default" by Martin Zuther, CC BY-SA 4.0, with the green lemon image by Clker-Free-Vector-Images (CC0).
  JSFX version released under GPLv3 license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/Squishy/squishy_default.png
  Dependencies/Squishy/squishy_lemonade.png
  Dependencies/Squishy/squishy_lime.png
  Dependencies/Squishy/squishy_bloodorange.png
  Dependencies/Squishy/LICENSE-skin.txt
